{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You squat and squint your eyes trying to read what is written on the piece of paper glued to the canvas.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The paper is yellowed. The text indicates that it was bought at the Vibrant Vistas Gallery. It also says that this particular piece was bought on June 17th, 1969.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: Vibrant Vistas Gallery... The address... I believe it's somewhere around downtown. And the date: the 17th of June, 1969. This is probably when it was bought. #line:0d53691 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Your attention is caught by a small handwritten note on the stamp - “For my beloved Diana, on one of the most important days of her life. - Aidan Foster.”][/nomarkup]
-> {$pcName}: Does the name Aidan Foster ring any bells? #line:0266774
{$kieran}:  Aiden Foster. I've seen that name once before. Before I was Embraced, I was one of Kate's other ghouls. I helped Diana from time to time with the papers and stumbled upon an envelope with the guy's name on it. Asking her about it was a touchy subject.
-> {$pcName}: Good to know. May be important. Thanks Kieran. #line:0893dd5 
